SessionTaskEventData.description:
Data for task lifecycle events (`task.created`, `task.updated`).

Carries the full task snapshot so consumers never need a follow-up read;
UIs reconcile by `task.id` (snapshot-then-delta).

oneOf.description:
Replace dashboard placement metadata. Omit to keep current placement;
send `null` to detach the report from its dashboard; send an object
to overwrite the placement.
